id: pm-rl-proposer-program
title: Evolve bounded proposal strategies across recursive generations
description: "Extend fixed recipe arms with a sealed typed proposal program that changes feature construction, curriculum and search strategy using development outcomes. Existing process, recipe, lineage and resource APIs remain authoritative."
type: Feature
pm_format_version: 2
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[4]: acceptance,evolution,"gh:unbraind/pm-rl#145",proposer
created_at: "2026-11-04T20:40:44.145Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-05T02:20:47.587Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "A positive control promotes an actual changed strategy across two recursive generations; metadata-only changes cannot pass.; Predeclared inner and outer statistical gates, contamination checks, cohort limits and equal total optimizer and inference budgets apply.; Invalid programs stop before effects. Rejection and post-promotion regression restore the prior content-addressed program while retaining evidence.; Typed SDK and CLI, compact TOON and JSON, typed remedies, README and example, read-only public tracker validation, seeded 500-sequence state properties, interleavings, packed acquisition and npm/Bun CI evidence."
parent: pm-rl-apvf
comments[19]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-04T20:40:54.233Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: recipe.ts seededRecipes changes values in fixed recipe domains; improver.ts updateImprover preserves arm configs and posterior-mixture strategy; recursive-improver.ts supplies durable comparisons. Current host version is 2026.11.4; pinned SDK 2026.11.2 public declarations expose tracker and transaction primitives but no proposer-program API. Sibling pm-context, pm-jev, pm-rlm and pm-swarm documentation exposes context, inference, recursive query and orchestration, not algorithm evolution. No open package PR or tracker item duplicates this scope; pm-rl-rsipower remains the separate powered-corpus evaluation task. Reuse existing process, recipe, lineage, checkpoint and controller boundaries; no trainer replacement or arbitrary code capability."
  "2026-11-04T20:50:52.371Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses a depth-four typed arithmetic AST over exact development count ratios, deterministic selection, feature masks/ngrams and training-only curricula. The isolated proposer uses the existing process reservation, staged completion, accounting and CAS APIs with zero optimizer/inference allowance and no inherited environment. Existing recipe validation and paired evaluation-plan gates remain authoritative. Both code identity and emitted recipe instructions must change before promotion. Programme, comparisons and rejected artifacts remain in durable SDK receipts; final audit failure selects the prior artifact without deleting evidence."
  "2026-11-04T21:10:22.426Z",codex-agent,"Measured validation: 500 seeded sequences and 2000 random program operations passed, including old-input replay, CRLF variants, relationships, custom status registries and ambient focus, with state read back through the real SDK. Six additional targeted tests passed; the three new proposer modules measured 100% lines, branches and functions in the focused coverage run. Ten ordinary-writer interleavings covered every forward coordinator boundary for reservation and publication. The linked strict-schema test passed through pm test --run --progress. The public non-git read-only copy contained 123 items and 100 SDK-role terminal items, remained byte-identical, and yielded two processes with zero extra jobs on replay. Packed acceptance exposed an SDK dependency read in the worker sandbox; removing that dependency so the child only loads the capability interpreter and shared identity helpers."
  "2026-11-04T21:22:21.200Z",codex-agent,"Final overlap refresh: current host SDK 2026.11.4 exposes 120 public declaration files with no proposer, proposal-program or recursive-improver API. Current sibling main README checks: pm-context 363e8bc5092faa9c48909ac3e2ebe8ce93c0f556, pm-jev 9307301889493d6edac569d49eeda516e24dea7d, pm-rlm b1fe01e2271abbbea9f8be554d4e4b135063cd7a, pm-swarm 5d8153cc79d03a454785a8b5e13ff11bba6c0e24; none documents proposal-program evolution. Shared meta search reservations now account for worst-case optimizer samples, proposal calls, outer promotions and inner/outer promotion headroom before work. The final targeted six-test run passed with 100% line/branch/function coverage across proposer modules and 15 ordinary-SDK interleavings at all five forward boundaries of three shared-state paths. Disposable behavioral revert: baseline exit 0; metadata-only mutateProposer replacement exit 1 with AssertionError; restored implementation exit 0."
  "2026-11-04T21:26:39.252Z",codex-agent,"Follow-up pm-rl-history-status-roles tracks a pre-existing hardcoded terminal-status projection in the public improver history builder. The proposer does not add a status classifier; new read-only public validation uses SDK registry roles. Execution of sealed datasets passed with Git absent from PATH: 32 durable steps, five learner fits, ten process jobs, zero promotions on this small refusal corpus, successful replay and a 536-byte compact JSON result."
  "2026-11-04T21:27:07.676Z",codex-agent,"Final local evidence: all five host acquisition modes passed against pm 2026.11.4 using the same captured npm artifact SHA-256 a7f5edab2544aa1e00c74bb1ab613839d8eedb5b20eabcf594d48a4936a62ab8: npm global, Bun global, npx, bunx and project-local. Each validated, executed five fits and replayed successfully; compact JSON was 536 bytes and TOON 539 bytes. Typecheck, test compilation and lint passed; docstring gate covered 62 files and 534 declarations; zero duplicate clones. Public validation measured 123 items, 100 terminal by SDK role, two processes, zero replay jobs, zero optimizer updates or inference tokens, 1133 ms process wall, 5 ms compute and 3068 bytes stored; source fingerprint unchanged. This is execution/replay evidence, not a held-out quality claim. Full npm and Bun release gates remain delegated to exact-head CI at unchanged thresholds; no local full suite was started."
  "2026-11-04T21:27:24.074Z",codex-agent,"Local strict health found no history drift or integrity errors, but exited 1 because the machine-installed pm-github extension runs host 2026.11.4 while this repo deliberately pins SDK 2026.11.2. A legacy provenance-domain advisory also remains. No history repair or dependency bump was performed. The clean CI checkout owns strict-health acceptance without ambient extensions."
  "2026-11-04T21:31:35.100Z",codex-agent,"Review handoff: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/145 is ready for review. Initial CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/41916417456 is queued for npm Node 22, npm Node 26 and Bun Node 26 full release gates. The PR records the exact final-head run URL, counts and unresolved checks. No merge or release; implementation and follow-up items remain open and the claim is released."
  "2026-11-04T21:43:55.130Z",codex-agent,"Added a focused CLI recovery guard regression: both force_takeover and forceTakeover spellings refuse unusable programme identities before creating process jobs. The new test passed (1/1), test compilation and lint passed; eight feature tests now pass across focused runs. Final-head CI will rerun after this test-only change. No runtime or packed artifact behavior changed."
  "2026-11-04T21:47:00.667Z",codex-agent,"Acceptance tightened during final review: the positive control now uses 256 independent synthetic units per generation, matching the production compartment cap. Actual isolated strategy selection still promotes 0 to 2 to 4 through both generations with inner and outer gates unchanged. The focused isolated-positive test passed at the cap; repeating the disposable metadata-only revert and refreshing the captured package to include corrected documentation before final CI handoff."
  "2026-11-04T21:58:08.173Z",codex-agent,"Final bounded acceptance: 256-unit positive control and disposable behavioral revert both pass (baseline 0, metadata-only replacement 1 with AssertionError, restored 0). All five packed modes pass again against pm 2026.11.4 using captured artifact SHA-256 08e45e6def2f5b35fc77f9dabc11cc4258d28a6adfa702c4a1509f0445c8511f; 25 learner fits across five fresh trackers, successful replay in each, JSON 536 bytes and TOON 539 bytes. CI remained incomplete within the initial 30-minute wait window: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/41916932623 had Node 22 running and Node 26/Bun queued; https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/41918861049 was queued. This final evidence commit requires fresh exact-head CI; PR 145 records its run URL and pending gate counts. No full-gate success or external review approval is claimed. Cubic/Sourcery quotas, skipped CodeRabbit and expired Greptile leave reviews unavailable. No local full release suite was run."
  "2026-11-04T23:17:23.881Z",codex-agent,"Review round on 581cb3d: fetched both unresolved threads with all comments and the latest CodeRabbit review (no Outside diff range findings). Branch includes current main. Verify shared promotion-headroom documentation and reject worst-case process resource totals before the controller lease; add behavioral revert proofs and run unchanged npm/Bun release gates."
  "2026-11-04T23:21:09.714Z",codex-agent,"Both findings verified and fixed: PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs6z1ICM documents permitted_promotions >= fits + config.generations plus existing shared charges, with no refund on completion/refusal/interruption/replay. PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs6z1ICS reuses approvedResources and checks every RESOURCE_KEYS entry against two IMPROVER_MAX_ATTEMPTS per fit plus all proposer processes before withRlController. Process training_steps count fits, while meta samples count optimizer updates. Whole PR diff self-review found no additional instance of these defect classes. Dist is ignored, rebuilt locally, and not committed by this repo."
  "2026-11-04T23:21:11.257Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof in a disposable non-git source copy: baseline two regressions passed (exit 0); moving only the resource guard into the controller callback failed (exit 1, AssertionError) because a real live competing lease returned loop_controller_active instead of process_budget_exhausted; removing only the guard failed the same regression; reverting only the approval documentation failed its contract test. Restored implementation and docs passed 2/2 (exit 0). docs/proposer-revert-evidence.json records all cases. Strengthened exact-budget controller test passed with five fits, ten jobs, zero-token allowance, replay, six retained promotion slots and competing-search refusal. Linked pm test passed 2/2 using pm_context_mode=none and workspace_context_mode=snapshot; isolated mode has no source files, so snapshot is required."
  "2026-11-04T23:27:54.037Z",codex-agent,"Release-gate follow-up from prior Node 22 CI: 1483/1483 tests passed but V8 reported 99.99% branch coverage, naming index.ts:5689. A direct raw-V8 probe isolated a zero-count range containing only whitespace between a catch that always throws and its finally block; both real error branches executed. Separated proposer CLI error translation from outer signal cleanup with nested try/catch and outer finally, preserving all behavior. A minimal V8 control reproduces the original whitespace range and confirms this conventional layout removes it. Stopped the superseded local npm gate after this source edit; restart both complete gates on finalized source, with unchanged thresholds. Local strict health still has no integrity/history drift but retains existing ambient extension version skew and legacy provenance advisory; no history repair or dependency bump."
  "2026-11-05T00:07:27.924Z",codex-agent,"Full npm release run on finalized source is ongoing with unchanged 100% thresholds and two workers. One existing test reached its unchanged 300-second limit under high shared-host load: test/decision-recovery.test.ts, SIGKILL at every HTTP-to-PM receipt boundary replays one decision per query. No assertion failure beyond that timeout has appeared. Let the complete suite finish, retry this scenario alone, and record whether retry or final-head CI establishes success; Bun full release gate remains queued serially. No full-gate success is claimed yet."
  "2026-11-05T02:12:37.920Z",codex-agent,"Verification strategy update: stopped the load-affected local npm Node 24 full gate after 1317 reported passing entries (including the 31 release-policy tests) and passing review regressions. It had not completed coverage reconciliation or downstream checks. Five existing timing scenarios require serial Node 26 retries: HTTP receipt SIGKILL at 300 seconds; packed LM and process CLI subprocess limits at 20 seconds; canonical card 512-sequence property and recoverable card transaction matrix at 600 seconds. The matrix timeout canceled its remaining nested cases. No timing bounds or thresholds changed. Run those scenarios alone on the installed CI runtime, then use exact-head CI for the full npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 gates; preserve the shared 30-minute CI cutoff and report pending checks honestly."
  "2026-11-05T02:18:55.615Z",codex-agent,"Serial Node 26 retry of the HTTP receipt SIGKILL scenario also reached its unchanged 300-second limit. This is not a successful retry; keep the full release verdict pending exact-head CI. Stopped remaining broad retries on the overloaded host. All ten proposer tests passed in the partial full run, including both new review regressions, 500 model sequences, 15 interleavings, isolated positive control, and exact-budget non-git controller/replay. Preserve local timing failures instead of altering thresholds or calling the release gate green. Complete static/package checks and push for the unchanged npm/Bun CI matrix."
  "2026-11-05T02:20:43.998Z",codex-agent,"Final local checks on Node 26 passed: release-policy tests 31/31; typecheck, build, test compilation, lint, zero-duplicate gate, docstrings (62 files / 534 declarations), release-publish attestation, git identity audit, production dependency audit, package dry-run, changelog regeneration and changelog check. Focused review verification passed 4/4, linked pm verification 2/2, and all ten proposer tests passed within the interrupted full coverage run. Behavioral reverts remained baseline 0, guard moved after lease 1, guard removed 1, docs reverted 1, restored 0. All stopped test worker groups are gone. Full npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 gates, whole-source coverage reconciliation and a green release verdict remain pending exact-head CI; the Node 26 receipt timing retry did not pass. No merge, release or review-thread mutation."
